Most of the .trc files in this directory are unmodified TN3270 data-stream
traces from the x3270 project's own test suites, and are used here for the
same purpose: replaying a recorded host session against an emulator.

  Upstream: https://github.com/pmattes/x3270 (suite3270 4.5)
  From s3270/Test: every .trc not listed below
  From b3270/Test: ignore_eor.trc invalid_command.trc invalid_eua.trc
                   invalid_ra.trc invalid_sba.trc invisible_underscore.trc
                   no_flags.trc reverse.trc short_eua.trc short_ge.trc
                   short_mf_attr.trc short_mf_count.trc short_ra_addr.trc
                   short_ra_char.trc short_ra_ge.trc short_sa.trc
                   short_sba.trc short_sfe_attr.trc short_sfe_count.trc
                   short_sf.trc

fields.trc, three-fields.trc and password-field.trc are this project's own.
Their TELNET negotiation is the same exchange as reverse.trc's; the screens
that follow it are ours.

